                You can log into <a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/home/dashboard?project={{ gcp_project }}&organizationId={{ gcp_organization }}" target=_blank>https://console.cloud.google.com/home/dashboard?project={{ gcp_project }}&organizationId={{ gcp_organization }}</a> using your Red Hat SSO credentials.<br>
                NOTE: When this OPEN environment expires, the project and all of its contents will be destroyed.  All data will be irrecovably removed. Please regularly back up your data and script your changes in case you need to rebuild.<br>
                NOTE: It can take a few minutes for your project to become visible in the GCP Web UI.
